# Voice AI Lead Qualifier

AI-powered voice agent that answers calls, qualifies leads, handles objections, and books appointments - 24/7.

## What It Does
- Answers incoming calls
- Qualifies leads (budget, timeline, pain points)
- Handles common objections
- Books appointments automatically
- Sends SMS confirmation

## Tech Stack
VAPI/Retell AI + OpenAI GPT-4 + Google Calendar + HubSpot

